{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:948fa462ef8604c1","name":"Pursuer-Class Enforcement Ship","source":{"id":"source:reference-948fa462ef8604c1","title":"Pursuer-Class Enforcement Ship","revision":20028,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:03:35Z","sha256":"7f0634e73e7f4353e2731dff6ec69dd5d3f2334adde54da8fe2da14c91ca1961","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20028","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Pursuer-Class%20Enforcement%20Ship&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-948fa462ef8604c1","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mandalorian Protectors"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mandalorian_Protectors","referenceId":"reference:925b0878b8907e40"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Pursuer"]},"-Class Enforcement Ship is a patrol vessel and fast transport designed by MandalMotors with Mandalorians specifically in mind. The ship is popular with ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mandalorian Protectors"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mandalorian_Protectors","referenceId":"reference:925b0878b8907e40"}," during ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", but the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Pursuer"]},"-Class also becomes a sought-after ship among non-Mandalorian police forces and bounty hunters across the galaxy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The stock ",{"tag":"i","children":["Pursuer"]}," is fast, with good armament and adequate shields. Though its cargo capacity is not up to par with other interstellar transports and freighters, it can be easily relegated to a transport role in a pinch. Passenger space is limited to five cramped cells and a couple of bunks, and the cargo area is adequate for securing contraband and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ground Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ground_Vehicles"},". Even though it is a capable craft right off the assembly line, few ",{"tag":"i","children":["Pursuers"]}," go long without aftermarket modification.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Following ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Pursuer"]},"-Class continues to see production and distribution across the galaxy with few changes to its basic design. Its fearsome reputation, combined with its capabilities, is just as valuable to potential owners as its actual weapon systems are.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["With his Firespray-31, ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Slave I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Slave_I","referenceId":"reference:767ea757309f73a1"}]},", in impound, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Boba Fett"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Boba_Fett","referenceId":"reference:8d500571566e79a7"}," uses a modified ",{"tag":"i","children":["Pursuer"]},"-Class, dubbing it ",{"tag":"i","children":["Slave II"]},". The ship serves him well until it is nearly destroyed at ",{"tag":"a","children":["Byss"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Byss?action=edit&redlink=1"},". Fett's modified ",{"tag":"i","children":["Pursuer"]}," includes a rear-firing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Proton Torpedo Launcher"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Proton_Torpedo_Launcher"},", an improved sensor array, and improved shield generators and sublight engines.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Normal)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Pursuer"]},"-Class Enforcement Ship Statistics (CL 7)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transport"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transport"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children